<title>USA: Martin Industries to shut down division.</title>
<headline>Martin Industries to shut down division.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Ala. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Industries Inc said on Monday it will discontinue its metal office furniture operation to redirect the plant's assets into more profitable businesses.</p>
<p>Closing this division will result in a fourth-quarter charge of $1.4 million, or $0.20 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
